<title>NEW ZEALAND: CRICKET-ENGLAND 228 AT END OF 1ST INNINGS VS NZ.</title>
<headline>CRICKET-ENGLAND 228 AT END OF 1ST INNINGS VS NZ.</headline>
<dateline>CHRISTCHURCH 1997-02-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>England were all out for 228 at the end of their first innings in reply to New Zealand's 346 on the third day of the third and final cricket test against New Zealand at Lancaster Park on Sunday.</p>
<p>Scores:</p>
<p>New Zealand 346</p>
<p>England 228 (M. Atherton 94 not out, G. Allott 4-74).</p>
